//! Tests of the MCP module: golden vectors generated by the reference's own code
//! (`testdata/generate.mjs`), the ported reference specs (`mcp-tool-registry.service.spec.ts`,
//! `mcp-tool-executor.service.spec.ts`), the executor end to end with the in-memory doubles,
//! and the endpoint in process.

